<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαιρέομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choose and
				associate with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινάς τινι ξυμβούλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.63
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑωυτῷ π. τινά</span>
			<i>take for one's companion</i> or <i>ally,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὸν αὑτοῖς
			[διαιτητήν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				D.
				59.45
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφίσιν αὐτοῖς ἄρχοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					35.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ αἰσυμνήτης τοὺς προσεταίρους -εῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					57.7
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.56.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				84.38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>choose in addition to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.2.39
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγοὺς πρὸς τοῖς
			ὑπάρχουσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.1.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαιρεῖν</span>
			<i>appoint as</i> one's <i>assistant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				58.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>: aor.
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσελών</span> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 iii 9
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				3p.76
			</span></i>, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>).</div>
